Description: Deliver print notifications in older Android embedding apps
 Restore the API-26 channel guard from Ibrahim Sevinc's original print support
 (8e18ea5ff834e2f80cdce25722ffaee682263997), removed in the later API-29 cleanup
 (30166164a5d230d4e0ceb47468365224905a090c). Flat Headset supports API 24.
 Resolve the host application's provider instead of hard-coding aFreeRDP's
 package name. This retains aFreeRDP's authority and matches embedding apps'
 ${applicationId}.fileprovider declaration.
Author: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Origin: other, Flat Headset Android compatibility work; channel guard from
 https://github.com/FreeRDP/FreeRDP/commit/8e18ea5ff834e2f80cdce25722ffaee682263997
Forwarded: no
Last-Update: 2026-11-02

